  "returns": "\n\n                    <p>A dictionary of selected fields and their values.</p>\n                    <p>Available fields:\n                \n    \n    <ul>\n        \n            <li>\n                <p>Primary:</p>\n                \n    \n    \n    <ul>\n        \n        <li >\n            \n                <p><b>id</b> -\n                    ID of an object;</p>\n            \n            \n        </li>\n        \n        <li >\n            \n                <p><b>schedule</b> - Schedule.</p>\n\n                \n\n                \n                    <p>This field references objects returned by\n                    <a href='https://usosapps.vistula.edu.pl/developers/api/services/events2/#event_type_schedule'>event_type_schedule</a> method. See its <b>returns</b> section\n                    for possible subfields.</p>\n                \n            \n            \n        </li>\n        \n        <li >\n            \n                <p><b>is_enabled</b> -\n                    boolean.</p>\n            \n            \n        </li>\n        \n    </ul>\n\n            </li>\n        \n            <li>\n                <p>Secondary:</p>\n                \n    \n    \n    <ul>\n        \n        <li >\n            \n                <p><b>event_channel</b> - Event channel.</p>\n\n                \n\n                \n                    <p>This field references objects returned by\n                    <a href='https://usosapps.vistula.edu.pl/developers/api/services/events2/#event_channel'>event_channel</a> method. See its <b>returns</b> section\n                    for possible subfields.</p>\n                \n            \n            \n        </li>\n        \n    </ul>\n\n            </li>\n        \n    </ul>\n</p>",
